{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VjhAZEbbeo1795163898.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地股市全線向下。</p><p></p><p>四大指數均低開，上證指數一度跌至3,500點邊緣，深成成分指數及創業板指數，收市跌逾百分之3。</p><p></p><p>半導體股下跌，內銀股造好。滬深兩市成交1.42萬億元人民幣，較上日增加1,170億元人民幣。</p><p></p><p>總結全個星期，四大指數均錄得跌幅，以創業板指數跌幅最大，全周跌逾百分之8。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:43:56.245733+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T21:17:35.240257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:13.784883+00:00","content_hash":"550b88e2f00b52744a3a8a68a6c277ddb78a64ef2bd4707aee3ce83c0ce2fd87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T09:43:56.245733+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}